1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:02,590
In 1920,

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:03,610
one man promised

3
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:04,550
to grow your money

4
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:05,730
by 50%

5
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:08,071
in 45 days.

6
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,790
Charles Ponzi said

7
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:10,550
he was trading

8
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:13,430
international postal coupons.

9
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:14,973
He wasn't.

10
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,770
He paid early investors

11
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:18,730
with money from

12
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:19,730
new ones,

13
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:20,290
and the crowds

14
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,085
kept coming.

15
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,670
When reporters checked,

16
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:26,430
there weren't enough coupons

17
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:27,390
in the world

18
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:28,761
to cover it.

19
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:31,970
The scheme collapsed

20
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:33,270
in August,

21
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:34,050
and it still carries

22
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:35,000
his name.
